  "an10.179:1.1": "vo bhikkhave desissāmi anariyadhammañ ca, ",
  "an10.179:1.2": "taṃ suṇātha . . . pe . . . 2. ",
  "an10.179:1.3": "Katamo ca bhikkhave anariyo dhammo? ",
  "an10.179:1.4": "Pāṇātipāto . . . pe . . . ",
  "an10.179:1.5": "micchādiṭṭhi. ",
  "an10.179:1.6": "Ayaṃ vuccati bhikkhave anariyo dhammo. 3. ",
